WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Number three, your confidence in your self-belief.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.960
How much do you trust yourself to go after what you want?

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.200
Think about speaking up, being seen and taking up room.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.040
Are you taking the steps to go and do

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.920
what is required to get your goals?

